"no_l2d":false,"text":["游泳让人们的生活范围从陆地拓展到了水中，我想，一万年前的人们因此将它记录了下来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["和平乌鲁","","Ulu","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["哦……多好的话题，人与河马，人与自然，人与水——这令我想起了草原上的雨季。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["和平乌鲁","","Ulu","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610012490","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那总是一段美好的时光，暴雨倾盆，冲刷浮游的灰与干燥的热。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["哦……？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011923","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我本以为您不喜欢水，考虑到您在开幕式上的……意外。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["和平乌鲁","","Ulu","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610012073","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["对那些装在管子里的水——那些你们所谓的自来水，我可确实没什么好感。但是雨水和雨季——它们带来生命与繁荣，就像火焰。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["和平乌鲁","","Ulu","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我还记得那些时节，我看见孩子们走到水边，畏惧地探进手指与脚趾，然后他们大胆起来，同水波欢笑、嬉戏。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["和平乌鲁","","Ulu","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610012533","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["最终，他们学会怎么同泉眼、溪流与湖泊相处，怎样敬畏地、又勇敢地驾驭水流。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":{}},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["维尔汀","","Vertin","","